msgid "No returns action applies to this code — shown read-only."
msgstr "该码没有可用的退货操作——仅作只读展示。"

#: includes/class-veazen-returns.php:222
msgid "Release for resale"
msgstr "释放再售"

#: includes/class-veazen-returns.php:226
msgid "Clear the first-scan lock so the next customer scan shows green again? The release is audited and counted."
msgstr "确定解除首扫锁定，让下一位顾客扫码重新显示绿色？释放操作会写入审计日志并累计次数。"

#: includes/class-veazen-returns.php:238
msgid "QC note (optional)…"
msgstr "质检备注（可选）…"

#: includes/class-veazen-returns.php:241
msgid "Register return (RMA)"
msgstr "登记退货（RMA）"

#: includes/class-veazen-returns.php:245
msgid "Register this return? A revealed scratch code becomes officially refurbished on the verify page."
msgstr "确定登记这条退货？已刮开刮码的商品将在验证页显示为官方翻新。"
